    "updated_at": "2026-03-31T16:24:35Z",
    "body": "What is \"top level\" here? [HTML](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-environment-top-level-origin) says \"implementation defined\"... Is it supposed to check the top window's origin?\r\n\r\nGecko blocks any request if a third party iframe is involved at all - ABA is also blocked. Per our telemetry nobody is doing ABA permission request and so far nobody complained. ",
